From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Trotta <44127594+Ahajha@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 19:29:14 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix: Upgrade everything (#2)

Wanting to pull Bazel 9 for the prebuilt protobuf toolchains, this ended up needing to update every bazel dependency, plus Rust, which in turn requires a bunch of clippy fixes. Best to get this out of the way, though, so it'll make iteration faster.
